OL,3,CIllegal cigarettes, vapes and
OL,4,Ccounterfeit toys worth #250,000 seized
OL,6,FIllegal and unsafe goods worth around
OL,7,Fa quarter of a million pounds have
OL,8,Fbeen seized from the streets across
OL,9,FSouthampton.
OL,11,FSouthampton City Council's Trading
OL,12,FStandards Team removed items including
OL,13,Fillicit cigarettes, illegal vapes and
OL,14,Fcounterfeit products such as
OL,15,Felectrical goods, cosmetics, toys and
OL,16,Fclothing.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G1/4
