OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F384A1786384108
OL,3,CIllegal cigarettes, vapes and
OL,4,Ccounterfeit toys worth #250,000 seized
OL,6,FIt follows another operation involving
OL,7,FEuro Mini Mart and American Oriental
OL,8,FCandy & Vape on Swaythling High Street
OL,9,Fwhere inspectors discovered illegal
OL,10,Ftobacco, including cigarettes that are
OL,11,Fnot legally available on the UK market
OL,12,Fand for which no duty had been paid.
OL,14,FThe products were hidden beneath the
OL,15,Fcounter and in a bin in the car park.
OL,16,FAll items were seized and removed.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G2/4
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
