CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F384A1786384108
OL,3,CIllegal cigarettes, vapes and
OL,4,Ccounterfeit toys worth #250,000 seized
OL,6,FCouncillor Toqeer Kataria, Cabinet
OL,7,FMember for Communities, Safety and
OL,8,FLeisure at Southampton City Council,
OL,9,Fsaid: "These seizures demonstrate our
OL,10,Fcommitment to protecting residents
OL,11,Ffrom illegal and potentially dangerous
OL,12,Fproducts.
OL,14,F"The sale of illicit tobacco and
OL,15,Fillegal vapes undermines legitimate
OL,16,Fbusinesses, fuels criminal activity
OL,17,Fand can put people, particularly young
OL,18,Fpeople, at risk.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G3/4
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
